        "death of Parvezravan",
        "Parvezravan's death",
        "King Kisra's death"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Gurabad",
        "Shiruyeh"
      ],
      "comment": "Parvezravan: Death of Parvezravan",
      "content": "The sources conflict. In The Tale of Shiruyeh and Shirin, Eremite history says his masked son stabbed him to death in his bed. In Liloupar's memories, as the Abyss power engulfed Gurabad, Kisra turned into a dark monster. Present both as accounts rather than a settled fact.",
